{{Term/Store|Bright-Eyed Crab|Bright-Eyed Crabs|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Bright-Eyed Crab}}
Bright-Eyed Crabs can be found on freshwater shores in the [[Lanayru Great Spring]] and [[Eldin Canyon]]. Many of them live in the area surrounding [[Ne'ez Yohma Shrine]] in [[Zora's Domain]]. They are also sold by the traveling [[Merchant]]s [[Chumin]] and [[Bugut]].

Eating a Bright-Eyed Crab raw will restore one of [[Link]]'s [[Heart]]s. They can also be roasted by a [[Fire]] to make [[Blackened Crab]] or chilled by [[Ice]] to make [[Frozen Crab]]. [[Cooking]] one in a [[Cooking Pot]] will result in a meal that provides [[Stamina Restoration]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

